# Optional bring-up USB fallback for the TCL Flip 4 5G.
#
# The stock vendor image selects the AIDL USB gadget HAL. A generic system
# image can boot before that HAL receives a usable function configuration,
# leaving the USB port unenumerated. Force the vendor's supported legacy
# ConfigFS path when explicitly requested. Authentication remains controlled
# by ro.adb.secure; this file does not enable root adbd.

on post-fs-data
    setprop persist.sys.usb.config adb
    setprop persist.vendor.usb.config adb

on zygote-start
    setprop vendor.usb.use_gadget_hal 0
    setprop persist.sys.usb.config adb
    setprop persist.vendor.usb.config adb
    setprop sys.usb.config none
    setprop sys.usb.config adb
